  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Aktiviteten saknar beskrivning. Kontakta Sida f&#xF6;r mer information. Ring +46 8 698 50 00 eller skicka e-post till sida@sida.se.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of the project and consultancy fund is to raise the quality of the Swedish development co-operation with Honduras by deepened strategic analysis, project preparations, assessments and evaluations, etc. Financing of consultancies or studies often serve as a basis for decisions on future supports.</narrative>
